# Plugins, in order (ADR MAIL-010). The chart mounts its own copy of this
# list (tls only with a certificate) and of connection.ini and me.

# STARTTLS with the certificate in /tls (cert-manager, the chart).
tls
# SPF for HELO and MAIL FROM, DKIM verification: results only, nothing
# rejected here (the spam scorer weighs them, as on Global).
spf
dkim
# RCPT TO: the master registry through weldsuite serve.
weldsuite_rcpt
# DMARC and the Authentication-Results header in Cloudflare's form.
weldsuite_auth_results
# The raw message to the mail bucket, its key and envelope to mail.inbound.
weldsuite_queue
